{"seq":2,"slug":"spectrum-of-verifiability","title":"可验证性谱系：从单元测试到形式证明","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-frontier-research/rlvr-verifiable-reward-training/paradigm/spectrum-of-verifiability","wordCount":1963,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"可验证性谱系-从单元测试到形式证明\">可验证性谱系：从单元测试到形式证明</h1><p>「可验证奖励」这五个字容易让人以为验证是一个开关——要么能验、要么不能。实际工程里它是一条谱线：用正则抽一个最终答案是验证，跑一万条单元测试是验证，让 Lean 检查器逐步核对一个证明也是验证，但它们给出的信号强度、被钻空子的难度、搭建成本相差好几个量级。给任务选错验证档位，是 RLVR 项目失败最安静的方式：训练曲线正常上升，模型却在优化你根本不想优化的东西。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>可验证性不是一个布尔量而是一条连续谱线：同属「可验证奖励」的判定方式，在信号强度、可被钻空子的难度、搭建成本上相差好几个量级。谱线用「判定的机械化程度」排序，从 L0 格式检查、L1 精确匹配、L2 执行测试、L3 形式化证明一路到 L4 评审判定。选档的三个要素必须一起看：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>判定对象</strong>：奖励作用于最终答案（L1–L3 的默认形态）还是推理步骤（过程奖励），决定了信号的稀疏与密集。</li>\n<li><strong>两类错误</strong>：放过错误答案的漏洞率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>q</mi><mo>−</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q^-</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9658em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与误杀正确答案的误杀率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>p</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1-p^+</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9658em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，修法方向相反、此消彼长。</li>\n<li><strong>搭建成本与覆盖面</strong>：级别越高判定越可靠但越贵，且需要领域天然适配（形式化要求命题可被翻译成形式语句）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>最常见的误解是把「可验证」理解为有开关：实际上任何一档验证都有其假阳性与假阴性，训练曲线上升不等于模型在优化你想要的语义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"谱线的五级刻度\">谱线的五级刻度</h2><p>按「判定的机械化程度」从高到低，可以把常见验证方式排成五级：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>级别</th>\n<th>判定方式</th>\n<th>假阳性风险</th>\n<th>假阴性风险</th>\n<th>搭建成本</th>\n<th>典型场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>L0 格式</td>\n<td>正则 / 解析器查结构</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n<td>输出必须含 <code>\\boxed{}</code> 或合法 JSON</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L1 精确匹配</td>\n<td>抽取最终答案后比对</td>\n<td>中（等价形式漏判）</td>\n<td>中（抽取失败）</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>AIME 数值题、MATH-500</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L2 执行测试</td>\n<td>沙箱中运行测试用例</td>\n<td>低（但可被硬编码绕过）</td>\n<td>高（部分正确全判零）</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>代码生成、SQL、SWE-bench</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L3 形式化证明</td>\n<td>证明助手内核检查</td>\n<td>几乎为零</td>\n<td>高（形式化鸿沟）</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>Lean 定理证明、miniF2F</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L4 评审判定</td>\n<td>人 / 模型评审打分</td>\n<td>高（主观、可被说服）</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>持续投入</td>\n<td>开放问答、写作、智能体轨迹</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>L0 看似平凡却是 RLVR 的地基：R1-Zero 只用了准确性加格式两项奖励，格式项就是 L0。它的作用是让答案可抽取、训练可解析——没有这一层，L1 的比对无从谈起。L1 到 L3 的递进则是判定语义的不断收紧：L1 只看结论对不对，L2 要求程序在所有测试上表现正确，L3 要求推理过程本身在形式系统中无懈可击。</p>\n<h2 id=\"两类错误的经济账\">两类错误的经济账</h2><p>评价一档验证方式，核心是两类错误的比率。设 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>p</mi><mo>+</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>接受</mtext><mo>∣</mo><mtext>回答正确</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p^+ = P(\\text{接受} \\mid \\text{回答正确})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9658em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">接受</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">回答正确</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 为召回率，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>q</mi><mo>−</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>接受</mtext><mo>∣</mo><mtext>回答错误</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q^- = P(\\text{接受} \\mid \\text{回答错误})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9658em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">接受</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">回答错误</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 为漏洞率，RLVR 实际优化的目标是</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mtext>eff</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>p</mi><mo>+</mo></msup><mo>⋅</mo><mn mathvariant=\"double-struck\">1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>y</mi><mtext>正确</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>q</mi><mo>−</mo></msup><mo>⋅</mo><mn mathvariant=\"double-struck\">1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>y</mi><mtext>有漏洞</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{\\text{eff}}(y) = p^+ \\cdot \\mathbb{1}[y \\text{正确}] + q^- \\cdot \\mathbb{1}[y \\text{有漏洞}]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">eff</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0158em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8213em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">正确</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0158em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8213em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">有漏洞</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>q</mi><mo>−</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q^-</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9658em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 不为零时，每一分漏洞都是策略可以稳定开采的免费奖励——这正是 <a href=\"../technical-stack/reward-hacking-in-rlvr\">RLVR 下的奖励黑客</a>的入口：强化学习是对奖励函数任何缺陷的无情放大器。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>p</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p^+</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9658em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 不足同样致命：正确的解法因为格式偏差、等价表述或超时被判零，梯度就在教模型放弃正确思路。两类错误的修法方向相反——压 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>q</mi><mo>−</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q^-</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9658em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 靠加固验证器，提 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>p</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p^+</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9658em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 靠放宽抽取与容错，工程上的张力在于两者往往此消彼长。</p>\n<p>执行测试还有一层独特的假阴性结构：测试通过是必要条件而非充分条件，未覆盖的分支上代码可能是错的；反过来，完全正确的实现也可能因为一条边界测试写得苛刻而全军覆没。这就是为什么代码域的 RLVR 通常要配「测试生成」或多数投票来平滑噪声，具体模式归入<a href=\"../technical-stack/verifier-design\">验证器设计模式</a>讨论。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    Q[&quot;任务输出能否被&lt;br/&gt;程序完全判定？&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;不能&quot;| L4[&quot;L4 评审判定&lt;br/&gt;考虑 RLHF / 生成式验证器&quot;]&#10;    Q --&gt;|&quot;能&quot;| B{&quot;只需看&lt;br/&gt;最终结论？&quot;}&#10;    B --&gt;|&quot;是且答案唯一&quot;| L1[&quot;L1 精确匹配&lt;br/&gt;注意抽取鲁棒性&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt;|&quot;否&quot;| C{&quot;需要保证&lt;br/&gt;推理过程正确？&quot;}&#10;    C --&gt;|&quot;是&quot;| L3[&quot;L3 形式化证明&lt;br/&gt;评估形式化改写成本&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt;|&quot;否&quot;| L2[&quot;L2 执行测试&lt;br/&gt;沙箱隔离 + 用例质量&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    Q[\"任务输出能否被&lt;br/&gt;程序完全判定？\"] --&gt;|\"不能\"| L4[\"L4 评审判定&lt;br/&gt;考虑 RLHF / 生成式验证器\"]\n    Q --&gt;|\"能\"| B{\"只需看&lt;br/&gt;最终结论？\"}\n    B --&gt;|\"是且答案唯一\"| L1[\"L1 精确匹配&lt;br/&gt;注意抽取鲁棒性\"]\n    B --&gt;|\"否\"| C{\"需要保证&lt;br/&gt;推理过程正确？\"}\n    C --&gt;|\"是\"| L3[\"L3 形式化证明&lt;br/&gt;评估形式化改写成本\"]\n    C --&gt;|\"否\"| L2[\"L2 执行测试&lt;br/&gt;沙箱隔离 + 用例质量\"]</pre><h2 id=\"过程奖励插在哪一格\">过程奖励插在哪一格</h2><p>上面五级都在给「结局」打分。如果奖励的粒度细化到推理步骤——每一步单独判分——就得到过程奖励模型（PRM）。它在谱系上不是一个新层级，而是把 L1–L3 的判定对象从答案换成了步骤，密集信号换稀疏信号。这个方向源自 OpenAI 的「让我们一步步验证」（arXiv:2305.20050）与更早的过程-结局反馈对比研究（arXiv:2211.14275），但密集信号的代价是步骤标注极贵、且步骤判定本身难以机械化——PRM 在大规模 RLVR 实践中的种种水土不服，连同自动化标注的尝试，都放在<a href=\"../technical-stack/verifier-design\">验证器设计模式</a>里拆解。</p>\n<h2 id=\"把知名基准放回谱线\">把知名基准放回谱线</h2><p>理解谱系后，再看各家论文的评测表会清晰得多：AIME 与 MATH-500 是 L1——数值精确匹配，所以不同工作的分数差异里有相当一部分来自答案抽取的宽严不一；LiveCodeBench 与 SWE-bench Verified 是 L2——前者每次换新题防污染，后者用仓库隐藏测试判定补丁；miniF2F（arXiv:2109.00110）是 L3 的标准战场，DeepSeek-Prover（arXiv:2405.14333）这类工作直接在 Lean 里机器检查证明，得分几乎不含判定噪声；FrontierMath（arXiv:2411.04872）虽然形式上是 L1，但其研究级数学题目让「答案唯一且可机械比对」这个前提本身变得苛刻。至于 Humanity&#39;s Last Exam 这类前沿评测，相当比例的题目根本没有程序化判定，只能落到 L4——这也是它们争议不断的根源之一。</p>\n<p>值得警惕的是基准在谱线上的位置会漂移：同一道 L2 代码题，一旦其测试用例进入训练语料，它对模型的真实约束力就退化成 L0 的记忆匹配。数据污染问题及其对评测可信度的侵蚀，在<a href=\"../practice-frontier/open-problems\">开放问题</a>一篇中有专门讨论。</p>\n<h2 id=\"选档的降级陷阱\">选档的降级陷阱</h2><p>实践中最常见的错误是「为了方便而降级」：本该跑测试的任务用字符串相似度凑合，本该精确匹配的数学题直接丢给一个大模型当裁判。每一次降级都在悄悄抬高 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>q</mi><mo>−</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q^-</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9658em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，而且升高的部分不会出现在训练曲线上——它表现为模型学出一套针对粗糙验证器的应试技巧。反方向的升级也有代价：L3 的形式化验证要求先把非形式化命题翻译成 Lean 语句，这道自动形式化鸿沟至今没有干净解法。务实的选择是把验证强度当成与算法同等重要的设计变量来对待——哪些领域天然落在谱线高端、哪些只能借道模型评审，正是<a href=\"../domain-expansion/beyond-math-code\">哪些领域可以 RLVR 化</a>一篇的判断框架。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>可验证性是一条从格式检查到形式化证明的五级谱线，级别越高假阳性越少、搭建越贵。评价某档验证要看两个数：放过错误答案的漏洞率与误杀正确答案的误杀率，强化学习会把两者的缺陷都放大。选档过低等于给黑客开门，盲目升级则撞上形式化鸿沟。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"可验证性谱系：从单元测试到形式证明","id":"可验证性谱系-从单元测试到形式证明"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"谱线的五级刻度","id":"谱线的五级刻度"},{"level":2,"text":"两类错误的经济账","id":"两类错误的经济账"},{"level":2,"text":"过程奖励插在哪一格","id":"过程奖励插在哪一格"},{"level":2,"text":"把知名基准放回谱线","id":"把知名基准放回谱线"},{"level":2,"text":"选档的降级陷阱","id":"选档的降级陷阱"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"从 RLHF 到 RLVR：o1 与 R1 的启示","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-frontier-research/rlvr-verifiable-reward-training/paradigm/from-rlhf-to-rlvr"},"next":{"title":"标志性结果：R1-Zero 与数学竞赛跃升","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-frontier-research/rlvr-verifiable-reward-training/paradigm/landmark-results"}}